{
  "id": "long-way-home",
  "title": "Long Way Home",
  "titles": [
    "The Wire",
    "Same Amount, Every Cycle",
    "What It Was For"
  ],
  "description": "A recruit is quietly sending money or support back to someone off-world, and that obligation starts pulling against the crew's needs.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "text": "Payroll logs show the same cut, off-world, every cycle, going back further than anyone thought to check.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act1-logs",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The amount never changes. Neither does the account it goes to.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act1-letter",
      "type": "seed",
      "seeds": [
        {
          "target": "shop",
          "params": {
            "itemName": "Undelivered Letter"
          },
          "note": "A letter turns up in the recruit's effects, returned to sender, unopened -- more than once, judging by the creases."
        }
      ],
      "completionText": "The letter is bought back from the courier office.",
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act1-exchange",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "After the next payout, the recruit is first in line at the credit exchange, same as always.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge-1",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Wherever it's going, it has been going there a long time.",
      "position": {
        "x": 600,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act2-track",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Confirm the Recipient",
        "description": "Track down who's actually on the other end of the wire, {distance}, without tipping the recruit off.",
        "difficulty": "ROUTINE",
        "tags": [
          "diplomacy"
        ],
        "missionType": "DIPLOMACY"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act2-emergency",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Cover an Emergency Run",
        "description": "The wire isn't enough this cycle. The recruit asks for help covering a sudden shortfall, no questions.",
        "difficulty": "STANDARD",
        "tags": [
          "extraction"
        ],
        "missionType": "EXTRACTION_OP"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act2-checkin",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Check On Them Directly",
        "description": "The recruit finally asks the crew to actually go look in on the recipient in person, {distance} out.",
        "difficulty": "STANDARD",
        "tags": [
          "recon"
        ],
        "missionType": "RECON"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge-2",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Whatever the crew knows now, the recruit still doesn't know they know it.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1200,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-choice",
      "type": "choice",
      "text": "Where does the line get drawn?",
      "choiceOptions": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "label": "Help make it permanent"
        },
        {
          "id": "steady",
          "label": "Change nothing"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "label": "Let them go"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 1500,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-back-mission",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Make It Permanent",
        "description": "Set up something that doesn't need the recruit's cut every cycle, once and for all.",
        "difficulty": "HARD",
        "tags": [
          "extraction"
        ],
        "missionType": "EXTRACTION_OP"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-back-success-payoff",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "It holds. For the first time in a long time, the recruit isn't doing the math every payout.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "apply_perk",
          "params": {
            "perkName": "Provided For"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "adjust_stat",
          "params": {
            "attribute": "will",
            "amount": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-back-success-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "success",
      "text": "The wire finally stops needing to be a wire. One thing, at least, is settled for good.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": -75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-back-fail-payoff",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "It doesn't hold. The recruit is back to doing the math, plus interest on the attempt.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "apply_flaw",
          "params": {
            "flawName": "Stretched Thin"
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-back-fail-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "failure",
      "text": "The attempt falls through. The wire keeps going, and now it costs more just to keep it that way.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": 75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-steady-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "neutral",
      "text": "Nothing changes. The wire keeps going. So does the recruit.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-leave-story",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Rather than keep splitting the difference, the recruit asks to be let go -- somewhere that pays enough to stop needing a wire at all.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-leave-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "neutral",
      "text": "One fewer set of hands aboard. Wherever they've gone, the wire finally gets undivided attention.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": 150
      }
    }
  ],
